# Repo-root .dockerignore. Belangrijk omdat de build-context vanaf Sub-fase 2A
# de hele monorepo-root is — zonder deze lijst zou Docker hele node_modules-
# trees, .git, .next en dist-folders meesturen wat de build dramatisch traag
# maakt en de image-cache invalideert.

# Node
**/node_modules
**/.npm
**/.pnpm-store

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/.next
**/build
**/.turbo

# Version control / IDE
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.swp

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Test / coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Env (NOOIT meesturen)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
infra/.env.prod
infra/.env

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/.cache

# Docs (niet runtime-relevant — schept maar geen image-bloat)
*.md
docs/
